{
  "$schema": "is-preview/v1",
  "tag": "is-check-icon-button",
  "category": "actions",
  "title": "<is-check-icon-button>",
  "titleHtml": true,
  "description": "Documentación y demos del componente is-check-icon-button de InSoft.",
  "styles": ".cluster { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }\r\n    .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }\r\n    /* Simula la chrome de un reproductor: es el contexto real de appearance=plain */\r\n    .player-bar {\r\n      display: inline-flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.6rem;\r\n      padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;\r\n      border-radius: var(--is-radius-sm);\r\n      background: rgb(0 0 0 / 72%);\r\n      color: #fff;\r\n      font-size: 0.8125rem;\r\n      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\r\n    }\r\n    .player-bar .track {\r\n      width: 8rem;\r\n      height: 3px;\r\n      border-radius: 999px;\r\n      background: rgb(255 255 255 / 25%);\r\n    }\r\n    .player-bar .track > i {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      width: 40%;\r\n      height: 100%;\r\n      border-radius: inherit;\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n    }\r\n    .state-grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(9rem, 1fr));\r\n      gap: 0.75rem;\r\n    }\r\n    .state-grid > div {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      justify-items: center;\r\n      gap: 0.5rem;\r\n      padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;\r\n      border: 1px solid var(--is-border-soft);\r\n      border-radius: var(--is-radius-sm);\r\n      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--is-bg) 55%, transparent);\r\n    }",
  "storageKey": "docs-is-check-icon-button",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "<is-check-icon-button>",
      "lede": "Botón icon-only con dos estados mutuamente excluyentes: muestra un solo icono\r\n          según <code class=\"code\">checked</code>. Lo usan <code class=\"code\">is-video</code>\r\n          (play/pausa, mute) e <code class=\"code\">is-theme-toggle</code>.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\r\n            <span class=\"demo-label\">caso mínimo</span>\r\n            <div class=\"cluster\">\r\n              <is-check-icon-button\r\n                id=\"demoPlay\"\r\n                icon=\"mdi:play\"\r\n                checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"\r\n                label=\"Reproducir\"\r\n                checked-label=\"Pausar\"\r\n              ></is-check-icon-button>\r\n              <span class=\"card-meta\" id=\"playState\">estado: paused</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "html": "<strong>Los dos labels son obligatorios.</strong>\r\n          El icono cambia pero el botón es el mismo nodo: sin\r\n          <code class=\"code\">label</code> y <code class=\"code\">checked-label</code>\r\n          un lector de pantalla anuncia lo mismo en ambos estados."
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-check-icon-button</span>\r\n  <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:play\"</span>\r\n  <span class=\"attr\">checked-icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:pause\"</span>\r\n  <span class=\"attr\">label</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Reproducir\"</span>\r\n  <span class=\"attr\">checked-label</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Pausar\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"tag\">></is-check-icon-button></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pairs",
      "title": "Pares de iconos",
      "lede": "Cualquier par que represente dos estados opuestos. El componente no asume\r\n          semántica: tú eliges los iconos y los labels.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"cluster\" style=\"gap: 1.25rem;\">\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"\r\n              label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"\r\n              label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:weather-night\" checked-icon=\"mdi:weather-sunny\"\r\n              label=\"Cambiar a tema oscuro\" checked-label=\"Cambiar a tema claro\" checked></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"\r\n              label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:bookmark-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:bookmark\"\r\n              label=\"Guardar\" checked-label=\"Quitar de guardados\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:eye-off-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:eye\"\r\n              label=\"Mostrar contraseña\" checked-label=\"Ocultar contraseña\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "appearance",
      "title": "Appearance",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">appearance=\"plain\"</code> lo compacta y hereda el color del\r\n          contenedor: es la variante para chrome oscura sobre vídeo o imágenes.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\r\n            <span class=\"demo-label\">default · sobre superficie normal</span>\r\n            <div class=\"cluster\">\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"\r\n                label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"\r\n                label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <span class=\"demo-label\">appearance=\"plain\" · sobre chrome de vídeo</span>\r\n            <div class=\"player-bar\">\r\n              <is-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:play\" checked-icon=\"mdi:pause\"\r\n                label=\"Reproducir\" checked-label=\"Pausar\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n              <span>0:42</span>\r\n              <span class=\"track\"><i></i></span>\r\n              <span>3:15</span>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:volume-high\" checked-icon=\"mdi:volume-off\"\r\n                label=\"Silenciar\" checked-label=\"Activar sonido\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button variant=\"plain\" icon=\"mdi:fullscreen\" checked-icon=\"mdi:fullscreen-exit\"\r\n                label=\"Pantalla completa\" checked-label=\"Salir de pantalla completa\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "code": "<span class=\"tag\"><is-check-icon-button</span> <span class=\"attr\">variant</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"plain\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:volume-high\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">checked-icon</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"mdi:volume-off\"</span>\r\n  <span class=\"attr\">label</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Silenciar\"</span> <span class=\"attr\">checked-label</span>=<span class=\"val\">\"Activar sonido\"</span><span class=\"tag\">></is-check-icon-button></span>",
          "lang": "html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "states",
      "title": "Estados",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"state-grid\">\r\n            <div>\r\n              <span class=\"demo-label\">unchecked</span>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"\r\n                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div>\r\n              <span class=\"demo-label\">checked</span>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"\r\n                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" checked></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div>\r\n              <span class=\"demo-label\">disabled</span>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"\r\n                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" disabled></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div>\r\n              <span class=\"demo-label\">disabled + checked</span>\r\n              <is-check-icon-button icon=\"mdi:heart-outline\" checked-icon=\"mdi:heart\"\r\n                label=\"Añadir a favoritos\" checked-label=\"Quitar de favoritos\" disabled checked></is-check-icon-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keyboard",
      "title": "Teclado",
      "lede": "Deshabilitado pasa a <code class=\"code\">tabindex=\"-1\"</code> y no responde a teclado ni a puntero.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "<tr><th>Tecla",
            "Acción"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>Tab</code>",
              "Enfoca el botón (el host lleva <code>tabindex=\"0\"</code>)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>Enter</code> <code>Space</code>",
              "Alterna <code>checked</code> y emite <code>is-change</code>"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "title": "API live",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\r\n            <div class=\"cluster\">\r\n              <is-check-icon-button id=\"apiBtn\" icon=\"mdi:microphone\" checked-icon=\"mdi:microphone-off\"\r\n                label=\"Silenciar micrófono\" checked-label=\"Activar micrófono\"></is-check-icon-button>\r\n              <is-button id=\"apiToggle\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle()</is-button>\r\n              <is-button id=\"apiForce\" variant=\"outlined\">toggle(true)</is-button>\r\n              <is-button id=\"apiDisable\" variant=\"outlined\">Toggle disabled</is-button>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>"
        },
        {
